113
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:44,680
Okay.

114
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:49,820
They acted in a very unfriendly way and it also suggests, you know, a hint of violence even.

115
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:51,600
Okay.

116
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:52,600
Yeah.

117
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:53,600
Yeah.

118
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:58,000
So if somebody is hostile, they can maybe be aggressive and maybe to a point, violent.

119
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:58,130
That's right.

120
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,000
Okay.

121
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:00,670
So a hostile person.

122
00:05:01,110 --> 00:05:01,310
Yeah.

123
00:05:01,390 --> 00:05:04,170
Or a hostile environment, a dangerous environment.

124
00:05:04,450 --> 00:05:04,730
Okay.

125
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:06,480
Very hostile.

126
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:07,480
Very good.

127
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:08,480
Yeah.

128
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:14,640
Now because of these appalling working conditions, the labor movement decided to take drastic measures.

129
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:14,990
Drastic measures.

130
00:05:15,640 --> 00:05:16,640
Yeah.

131
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:17,640
Drastic measures.

132
00:05:17,640 --> 00:05:22,210
This is a really wonderful phrase and I think it would help us to listen to a few examples of this phrase in use.

133
