Example one.

134
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:32,110
The president was faced with some difficult decisions and was forced to take drastic measures to solve the crisis.

135
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:39,800
Example two.

136
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:47,480
The police took very drastic measures to control the protesters outside the government palace.

137
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:51,180
So we understand drastic measures as extreme actions or decisions, right?

138
00:05:51,520 --> 00:05:52,020
Yeah, exactly.

139
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:56,240
I think there's a saying that says desperate times call for drastic measures.

140
00:05:56,380 --> 00:05:58,520
No, desperate times call for desperate measures.

141
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:00,280
Dang.

142
00:06:00,280 --> 00:06:03,000
Well, okay, but it goes around there somewhere, right?

143
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:03,740
Something like that.

144
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:07,280
So if you really have an emergency, you need to do something drastic.

145
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:11,620
You have to take drastic measures or you can even say take drastic action.

146
00:06:12,080 --> 00:06:12,420
Okay.

147
00:06:12,420 --> 00:06:13,520
Very good.

148
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:14,720
