149
00:06:14,950 --> 00:06:23,210
After the protests ended in violence, people started to get angry because of the brutality the police showed.

150
00:06:23,470 --> 00:06:23,730
Okay.

151
00:06:24,910 --> 00:06:25,350
Brutality.

152
00:06:25,520 --> 00:06:26,520
Brutality.

153
00:06:26,520 --> 00:06:29,730
So maybe brutality and hostility are maybe similar, right?

154
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:31,210
A little bit similar.

155
00:06:31,640 --> 00:06:34,850
So brutality is the state of being harsh or very forceful.

156
00:06:35,610 --> 00:06:35,970
Okay.

157
00:06:36,090 --> 00:06:36,630
So brutality.

158
00:06:37,150 --> 00:06:39,190
Now, we also use the word brutal.

159
00:06:39,690 --> 00:06:39,810
Right.

160
00:06:40,030 --> 00:06:41,770
So that means harsh or very forceful.

161
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:46,940
Now sometimes we can use that word, but not in a harsh or forceful way, right?

162
00:06:47,200 --> 00:06:47,420
Yeah.

163
00:06:47,580 --> 00:06:48,640
And it's quite, yeah.

164
00:06:48,960 --> 00:06:52,100
I might say something like, oh my God, that test was brutal.

165
00:06:53,080 --> 00:06:54,200
It was brutal or...

166
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:55,800
So it was really hard or really difficult.

167
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:57,280
Right.

168
00:06:57,280 --> 00:07:00,860
So that's what you're saying with this word that it's very hard or it was very intense.

169
00:07:01,180 --> 00:07:01,320
Yeah.

170
00:07:01,380 --> 00:07:02,560
Maybe one more example.

171
00:07:03,060 --> 00:07:03,240
Okay.

172
00:07:03,260 --> 00:07:07,400
So for example, I can say, oh, I went for a run today and it was brutal.

173
00:07:07,740 --> 00:07:08,400
I'm so tired.

174
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:09,540
So it was really difficult.

175
00:07:09,880 --> 00:07:10,880
Yeah.

176
00:07:10,880 --> 00:07:11,880
Yeah.

177
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:14,090
And Marco, is this something that's used by everyone?

178
00:07:14,760 --> 00:07:18,710
That phrase, brutal, using in that context would be for younger people maybe.

179
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:21,170
Not really, you wouldn't really hear older people using it.

180
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:22,570
So it's a little bit slangy.

181
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:23,680
Yeah.

182
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,680
Yeah.

183
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:25,680
Okay.

184
