321
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:26,380
On May 1st, it's a holiday, and we actually have two holidays in May as well, because on the 24th, we actually celebrate the Battle of Pichincha, which is one of the decisive battles for the independence of Ecuador.

322
00:14:26,680 --> 00:14:29,620
So we don't mind having two holidays in the same month.

323
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:32,920
